{"3779470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno", "steam_appid": 3779470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno—A Thrilling Turn-Based RPG Adapted from the TOUGEN ANKI Anime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Based on the folklore of Momotaro, the original manga TOUGEN ANKI depicts a fierce feud between those who carry the blood of Oni and the descendants of Momotaro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having sold over 4 million copies, this beloved series is now coming to life as a game—TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno—releasing soon on Steam and mobile alongside the anime premiere in July 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/33496228f5c76f065e1be529ae8b7b0b.avif?t=1773728718\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ High-Quality 3D Combat, Just Like the Anime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D models and lifelike animations bring each character to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful visual effects recreate the original characters' actions, heightening the sense of realism and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/62c0e2112e2bc0a3923ff2412fd27f65.avif?t=1773728718\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Strategic Turn-Based RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect characters with unique abilities, form your ideal team, and build winning strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dynamic turn-based combat with visually striking skills and powerful team synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/2276a95fb426977ecd19c54c0634c30a.avif?t=1773728718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras_big/2276a95fb426977ecd19c54c0634c30a.webp?t=1773728718 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Deep Character Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the story mode to explore complex relationships and conflicts among characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced scenes and cinematic cutscenes enhance the experience—like watching the anime unfold before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Cross-Platform Support on Mobile &amp; PC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anytime, anywhere on your preferred device!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cross-platform data sync, you can seamlessly enjoy the world of TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno across mobile and PC without interruption.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno—A Thrilling Turn-Based RPG Adapted from the TOUGEN ANKI Anime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Based on the folklore of Momotaro, the original manga TOUGEN ANKI depicts a fierce feud between those who carry the blood of Oni and the descendants of Momotaro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having sold over 4 million copies, this beloved series is now coming to life as a game—TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno—releasing soon on Steam and mobile alongside the anime premiere in July 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/33496228f5c76f065e1be529ae8b7b0b.avif?t=1773728718\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ High-Quality 3D Combat, Just Like the Anime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D models and lifelike animations bring each character to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful visual effects recreate the original characters' actions, heightening the sense of realism and excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/62c0e2112e2bc0a3923ff2412fd27f65.avif?t=1773728718\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Strategic Turn-Based RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect characters with unique abilities, form your ideal team, and build winning strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dynamic turn-based combat with visually striking skills and powerful team synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras/2276a95fb426977ecd19c54c0634c30a.avif?t=1773728718\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779470/extras_big/2276a95fb426977ecd19c54c0634c30a.webp?t=1773728718 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Deep Character Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the story mode to explore complex relationships and conflicts among characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced scenes and cinematic cutscenes enhance the experience—like watching the anime unfold before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Cross-Platform Support on Mobile &amp; PC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anytime, anywhere on your preferred device!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cross-platform data sync, you can seamlessly enjoy the world of TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno across mobile and PC without interruption.</p>", "short_description": "Meet TOUGEN ANKI Crimson Inferno, a 3D turn-based RPG faithfully set in the world of the TOUGEN ANKI anime! Experience stunning 